{"n": 106, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "106.webp", "text": "1112100 REMOVING AND INSTALLING\nCYLINDER HEAD\n\nSince 1988 Models:\n\nDisconnect battery ground lead.\n\nDisconnect oxygen sensor plug.\n\nUnscrew exhaust pipes on exhaust manifolds\nand holder on transmission,\nJnstallation:\n\nCheck gaskets, replacing if necessary.\nCoat studs with copper paste “CRC\"*\nReplace self-locking nuts.\n\nTightening torque*.\n\nUnscrew plug and drain coolant.\nfnstallation:\n\nPour in coolant*** and bleed cooling system\n— see 17 00 039.\n\nReplace engine oil***.\n\nDisconnect accelerator cable (1).\n\nCars with Cruise Control:\n\nDisconnect cruise control cable (2).\n\nCars with Automatic Transmission:\nDisconnect throttle cable (3).\n\nInstallation:\n\nAdjust accelerator cable — see Group 35.\nAdjust cruise control cable — see Group 65,\nAdjust throttle cable — see Group 24.\n\n*. See Specifications\n** Source of Supply: HWB\n*** See Service Information of Gr. 00\n\n20 11260\n\nPull off plug (1)\n\nLoosen clamp (2).\n\nUnscrew nuts (3) and Iift out air cleaner with\nair flow sensor,\n\nPull off hose (4).\n\nPull off plug (5).\n\nDisconnect diagnosis plug (1)\nDisconnect hoses (2 ... 6).\nDisconnect fuel hose (7).\nUnscrew holder (8).\n\nPull off plug (1).\nPull off fuel hose (2)\nDisconnect plug (3).\nUnscrew bolt (4)\n\nPull off plug (1).\nDisconnect hoses (2 and 3).", "words": [["1112100", 0.2665, 0.069, 0.3151, 0.0796], ["REMOVING", 0.3283, 0.069, 0.388, 0.0796], ["AND", 0.3921, 0.0676, 0.4159, 0.0796], ["INSTALLING", 0.4205, 0.069, 0.4878, 0.0796], ["CYLINDER", 0.3278, 0.0849, 0.385, 0.0962], ["HEAD", 0.3896, 0.0849, 0.42, 0.0962], ["Since", 0.2655, 0.1167, 0.2908, 0.128], ["1988", 0.2953, 0.1167, 0.3191, 0.128], ["Models:", 0.3227, 0.1174, 0.3587, 0.128], ["Disconnect", 0.2655, 0.1326, 0.3186, 0.1432], ["battery", 0.3227, 0.1333, 0.3566, 0.1459], ["ground", 0.3602, 0.1333, 0.3936, 0.1459], ["lead.", 0.3977, 0.1333, 0.4184, 0.1432], ["Disconnect", 0.2655, 0.1492, 0.3186